Each case filters the domains of input by filter, the attributes of an inclusion, output is the filtered domains.
-- input --
a.com
b.com @ads
c.com @ads @cn
d.com @cn
include:other
-- filter --
-- output --
a.com
b.com @ads
c.com @ads @cn
d.com @cn
-- input --
